{"id":"naturaleza","lemma":"naturaleza","pos":"noun","rank":1019,"glosses":["nature"],"ipa":"/natuɾaˈleθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"naturalezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-naturaleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Amo la naturaleza.","en":"I love nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440215","words":[{"g":"master"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La naturaleza está llena de misterio.","en":"Nature is full of mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522034","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full","l":"lleno"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"mystery"}]},{"text":"Ella es curiosa por naturaleza.","en":"She's inquisitive by nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641928","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"curious, inquisitive","l":"curioso"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"La naturaleza es cruel.","en":"Nature is cruel.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"cruel"}]},{"text":"Él era pasivo por naturaleza.","en":"He was passive by nature.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"passive"},{"g":"for / by"},null]}]}